# Usage

`XmlNamespaces` holds the well-known URI strings: `xml`, `xmlns`, `xsi`, and `xsd`. Compare them with `Utf8XmlReader.NamespaceUriEquals` rather than copying the URI text into your code.

```csharp
if (reader.LocalNameEquals("nil") && reader.NamespaceUriEquals(XmlNamespaces.Xsi))
{
    // xsi:nil
}
```

